OL,3,GNEWSAUnion accuses ferries agency of
OL,4,Asabotaging Ferguson shipyard
OL,5,
OL,6,FA union representing workers at the
OL,7,Fnationalised Ferguson shipyard has
OL,8,Faccused Scotland's ferries procurement
OL,9,Fagency of trying to sabotage the firm's
OL,10,Ffuture.
OL,12,FGMB Scotland said CMAL boss Kevin Hobbs
OL,13,Fhad "intentionally undermined" the
OL,14,Fyard's reputation in a "pre-planned"
OL,15,Fattack when he told MSPs the yard
OL,16,Fshould not be given more CalMac ferry
OL,17,Forders.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,429,420,260,160,0,100
